demos.ai_disclosure:
Some content in Camping Resort Simulator was made with the help of generative AI tools and then reviewed and reworked by the developer:
- base 3D models for some buildings, props and characters, retouched by hand;
- the music of the in-game radio;
- the first draft of the translations;
- some promotional artwork.
Nothing is generated by AI while you play.

This game uses AI technology to assist in the creation of some content, including:
- Character renders, which were manually edited and refined by the developer;
- Background artwork;
- Certain animations, which were generated or assisted by AI tools;
- Selected pieces of the soundtrack (AI-assisted music).
All AI-generated or AI-assisted content is carefully curated, edited, and integrated by the development team to ensure a consistent, cohesive, and high‑quality player experience.

This game utilized generative AI tools during development to assist with the following aspects:
Generation and optimization of certain code snippets;
Creation and processing of some sound effects;
Machine translation and localization assistance for in-game text and UI strings.
Important note: All visual art assets in the game (including characters, environments, props, UI elements, icons, animations, etc.) are exclusively created by human artists and were not generated by any AI tools.
All AI-generated content (code, sound, translation) has been manually reviewed, revised, and tested to ensure quality, stylistic consistency, and compliance with applicable regulations. AI is not used for real-time generation of player-facing content; all released content is finalized prior to launch.
